      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A Song of degrees for Solomon. Except the LORD shall build the house, they labor in vain that build it: except the LORD shall keep the city, the watchman waketh in vain.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.127.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.127.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "It is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " vain for you to rise early, to sit up late, to eat the bread of sorrows: ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "for",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " so he giveth his beloved sleep.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.127.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.127.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Lo, children ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a heritage of the LORD: ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the fruit of the womb ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is his",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " reward.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.127.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.127.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "As arrows ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in the hand of a mighty man: so ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " children of the youth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.127.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.127.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Happy ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the man that hath his quiver full of them: they shall not be ashamed, but they shall speak with the enemies in the gate.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
